1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
You can build your own AI setup, on the laptop you already have.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Most of us don't have a powerful machine. No big GPU.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
This still works. And if you do have a GPU, it gets seriously powerful.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
It comes down to three things.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
One. A model running on your own machine. That's Ollama.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Two. Free tiers from Groq, Gemini, NVIDIA and OpenRouter.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Three. A free GPU. Kaggle gives you two.

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Now connect them. OmniRoute, an open source router, sits in front.

9
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:55,000
And Open WebUI gives you one chat page for all of it.

10
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Comment ai-local and I'll share the scripts and the guide.
